      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "現在是你挨打，憑什麼和我們談條件？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "就是就是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰沉的賞金獵人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "（他也沉默了......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "（不會真的咬死不說吧？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "（有點難辦，總不至於真的要逼供......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "text": "再抽他兩巴掌不就結了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "啊，說得太大聲了啦，凜冬姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰沉的賞金獵人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰沉的賞金獵人",
      "text": "居然敢小看我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰沉的賞金獵人",
      "text": "——該死的熊崽子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "凜冬姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "text": "什麼——？！呃啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "text": "你卑鄙......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰沉的賞金獵人",
      "text": "卑鄙？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰沉的賞金獵人",
      "text": "手段只要有用就好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰沉的賞金獵人",
      "text": "去死吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "索尼婭！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰沉的賞金獵人",
      "text": "該死，你這小鬼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰沉的賞金獵人",
      "text": "咳，呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "不許......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "不許傷害索尼婭姐......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "還差一下......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "text": "等等，古米！我沒事，別衝動！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "text": "我們還要問出孩子們的下落！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "我、我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陰沉的賞金獵人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "text": "古米......還好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "好慘，他死了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "沒有，他還活著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "親愛的羅莎琳，可以麻煩你幫我把這位先生抬到那邊去嗎？我要幫他止血，順便讓他“清醒”過來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "沒問題是沒問題......但你幹嘛突然這樣喊我，怪嚇人的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "好了好了，過來吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "凜冬姐，傷口......在流血，我、我幫你包紮！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "......對不起......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "對不起，凜冬姐，真理姐。古米......又闖禍了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "text": "別說傻話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "text": "你闖什麼禍了？你是救了我，我謝你還來不及。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "可是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "沒有可是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "古米，你在害怕，但還是保護了我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "text": "說得好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "text": "況且......古米，我清楚你的力氣有多大。如果你真的全力打中對方的腦袋，他現在早就該沒氣了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "那、那他——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "放心，人沒事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "能不能再敲他一次，直接把他敲醒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "沒事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "古米、古米控制住了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "text": "你控制住了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "text": "最後的那一下，你明明已經揮出去了，但是又收住了力道，我看得很清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "古米。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "還有凜冬，也過來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "不叫上我們？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "這是要玩什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "text": "吵死了，你別擠我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "滿地狼藉中，烏薩斯學生自治團的孩子們親密地聚在一起。\n真理牽起古米的左手，凜冬拉起右邊那隻。小熊們手拉著手，頭挨著頭，即使被他人的鬢髮掃得面頰發癢，也沒有人退開。\n古米將腦袋擠在同伴中間，用額頭輕輕碰碰同伴的前額，就像是她們一直以來玩耍時做的那樣。\n然後她獲得了一個親密的回撞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "古米，還記得我之前說的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "你已經做得很好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "別怕，我們都陪著你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "沒錯沒錯，小古米做得真不錯！最後那一下擋得漂亮！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "text": "呵呵，已經快要比還控制不住自己脾氣的某人要強了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "text": "啥？你說誰？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "噗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "凜冬姐別跳起來，小心傷口！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "古米、古米......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "古米真的......做到了？真的沒、沒用全力？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "text": "沒有。你做到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "我們一會就能把對方叫醒，然後問出那些孩子的下落。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "放心，我會讓他說出來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "text": "古米，你不僅保護了我們，還救了那幾個孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "古米......控制住了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "......古米做到了......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "要帶上這個，還有這個......嗯，多帶點小麵包！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "呼，背包終於收拾好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "爸爸媽媽，拉達馬上要準備去找你們了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "雖然凱爾希醫生說會很難，但我還是想去試一試！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "對了，拉達現在每次打人的時候已經不會再有停頓......也不會完全控制不住第三下的力氣了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "不會再讓姐姐們擔心......也不會讓爸爸媽媽擔心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "多虧了姐姐們，雖然還是會做噩夢，但是現在拉達已經不會那麼害怕了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "爸爸媽媽，拉達在這裡過得很開心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "啊，拉達還得去和姐姐們打聲招呼，這還是拉達頭一次自己出遠門，但是我一定還會回來，姐姐們一定要等著拉達......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "......呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "好，就錄到這裡好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "——出發啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
